---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Work | Mill City Web Studio" description="Selected website work by Mill City Web Studio.">
  <section class="section-shell page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Selected work</div>
    <h1>Start with the business. Build the site around it.</h1>
    <p>The portfolio starts with real client work — clear structure, custom visual direction, responsive development, and a practical launch setup.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell case-study">
    <div class="case-meta"><span>01</span><span>Featured project</span></div>
    <div class="case-grid">
      <div>
        <h2>MLAesthetics</h2>
        <p class="lede">A premium website for a results-oriented skincare studio in Bend, Oregon.</p>
        <p>The project included visual direction, responsive page design, treatment architecture, booking integration, technical SEO, domain configuration, and Cloudflare deployment.</p>
        <div class="pill-row"><span>Astro</span><span>Cloudflare</span><span>Responsive design</span><span>Local SEO</span><span>Booking integration</span></div>
        <a class="button secondary" href="https://mlaestheticsbend.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Visit live site ↗</a>
      </div>
      <div class="case-panel">
        <div>
          <span class="case-label">Project goal</span>
          <div class="case-quote">Give an established skincare professional a digital presence that feels as polished as the service itself.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-grid"><div><strong>Custom</strong><span>design system</span></div><div><strong>Fast</strong><span>static delivery</span></div><div><strong>Direct</strong><span>booking path</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell case-notes">
    <div><span>01</span><strong>Discovery + positioning</strong><p>Translate the owner's goals, services, and personality into a clear website direction.</p></div>
    <div><span>02</span><strong>Design + development</strong><p>Build a custom responsive experience rather than adapting a generic theme.</p></div>
    <div><span>03</span><strong>Launch + infrastructure</strong><p>Connect GitHub, Cloudflare, the client domain, booking flow, and technical search setup.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell upcoming"><div class="eyebrow">More coming</div><h2>The portfolio grows with the client work.</h2><p>No filler projects. New case studies will be added as real sites launch.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
